        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>怀孕第2个月要做的事</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n        background-color: #f4f4f4;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        padding: 20px;\n        margin: 0;\n    }\n    .container {\n        background-color: #fff;\n        border: 12px solid #fce86c;\n        padding: 30px 20px;\n        width: 800px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    h1 {\n        text-align: center;\n        font-size: 42px;\n        margin: 0 0 30px 0;\n        letter-spacing: 2px;\n        color: #000;\n    }\n    table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    th, td {\n        border: 1px dashed #c0c0c0;\n        padding: 15px;\n        font-size: 16px;\n        color: #333;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .section-header {\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-size: 18px;\n        text-align: center;\n        padding: 12px;\n        color: #000;\n    }\n    .header-blue { background-color: #dcf0f8; }\n    .header-yellow { background-color: #fdf175; }\n    .header-orange { background-color: #fcd558; }\n\n    .text-left { text-align: left; }\n    .text-center { text-align: center; }\n    .font-bold { font-weight: bold; }\n\n    .list-item {\n        margin-bottom: 12px;\n    }\n    .list-item:last-child {\n        margin-bottom: 0;\n    }\n\n    .flex-container {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n    .flex-content {\n        flex: 1;\n    }\n    .placeholder {\n        width: 120px;\n        height: 120px;\n        border-radius: 50%;\n        background-color: #f0f0f0;\n        border: 2px solid #ddd;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        color: #666;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        margin-left: 20px;\n        flex-shrink: 0;\n        overflow: hidden;\n        text-align: center;\n        box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n    <h1>怀孕第 2 个月要做的事</h1>\n\n    <table>\n        <!-- Section 1 -->\n        <tr>\n            <td colspan=\"4\" class=\"section-header header-blue\">孕检</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"text-center\">\n            <td class=\"font-bold\" style=\"width: 15%;\">孕周</td>\n            <td class=\"font-bold\" style=\"width: 15%;\">检查项目</td>\n            <td class=\"font-bold\" style=\"width: 25%;\">检查目的</td>\n            <td class=\"font-bold\" style=\"width: 45%;\">注意事项</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"text-center\">\n            <td rowspan=\"2\">孕 6-9 周</td>\n            <td>抽血</td>\n            <td>看胎心、胎芽</td>\n            <td>不建议太早去，太小不容易检查到，</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"text-center\">\n            <td>B超</td>\n            <td>确认宫内孕</td>\n            <td>第一次 B超建议准爸爸陪同</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Section 2 -->\n        <tr>\n            <td colspan=\"4\" class=\"section-header header-yellow\">饮食指南</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"text-center\">\n            <td class=\"font-bold\">重要营养</td>\n            <td colspan=\"3\">叶酸、维 B6、C（缓解孕吐，预防妊娠期牙龈炎）</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"text-center\">\n            <td class=\"font-bold\">饮食重点</td>\n            <td colspan=\"3\">少食多餐，饮食均衡</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td colspan=\"4\" class=\"text-left\">\n                <div class=\"flex-container\">\n                    <div class=\"flex-content\">\n                        <div class=\"list-item\">①食补：鱼肉、鸡肉、芹菜、南瓜、西红柿、小白菜、草莓、金桔</div>\n                        <div class=\"list-item\">②推荐食谱：番茄鸡蛋面、醋溜白菜、豌豆炒虾仁、清蒸鲈鱼、<br>彩椒炒藕片、蒜蓉粉丝蒸丝瓜、酸奶水果沙拉、香橙苹果汁</div>\n                        <div class=\"list-item\">③饮食禁忌：不吃保健品如天麻、人参、西洋参、灵芝、胖大海</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"placeholder\">\n                        [Photo: Fruit Salad]\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Section 3 -->\n        <tr>\n            <td colspan=\"4\" class=\"section-header header-orange\">重点事项</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td class=\"font-bold text-center\">胎儿变化</td>\n            <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"text-left\">心脏有规律地跳动，四肢开始长出，眼鼻清晰可辨</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td class=\"font-bold text-center\">孕妈变化</td>\n            <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"text-left\">子宫增大如鹅蛋大小，阴道分泌物增多，恶心、厌食、呕吐</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td class=\"font-bold text-center\">注意事项</td>\n            <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"text-left\">\n                <div class=\"list-item\">①避免尿路感染，多喝水，勤换内裤，每天用温水冲洗外阴</div>\n                <div class=\"list-item\">②可以使用护肤品，不要用功效型产品如美白、祛斑等</div>\n                <div class=\"list-item\">③避免用力的动作，不提重物、不干重活</div>\n                <div class=\"list-item\">④这个时期可能出现早孕反应身体不适，不擅自用药需遵医嘱</div>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
